              "id": "d",
              "text": "Do you know if who called and who they did contacted?"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": "Do you know who called and who contacted they?"
            }
          ],
          "explanation": "«Who called» es pregunta de sujeto; «who they contacted» contiene sujeto explícito."
        },
