              "id": "d",
              "text": "I'd like to know that the parts have arrived?"
            },
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "I'd like to know whether the replacement parts have arrived."
            }
          ],
          "explanation": "Se añade «whether» y se mantiene orden afirmativo."
        }
